    "drawingSvg": "<svg viewBox=\"0 0 240 145\" class=\"w-full h-full\"><defs><marker id=\"arr-20402\" viewBox=\"0 0 10 10\" refX=\"6\" refY=\"5\" markerWidth=\"5\" markerHeight=\"5\" orient=\"auto-start-reverse\"><path d=\"M 0 1.5 L 8 5 L 0 8.5 z\" fill=\"#000000\"/></marker></defs><rect x=\"14\" y=\"24\" width=\"70\" height=\"36\" rx=\"0\" fill=\"#f1f5f9\" stroke=\"#000000\" stroke-width=\"1.6\"/><text x=\"49.0\" y=\"45.0\" font-size=\"9\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-style=\"normal\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#000000\">V (dim n)</text><rect x=\"156\" y=\"24\" width=\"70\" height=\"36\" rx=\"0\" fill=\"#f1f5f9\" stroke=\"#000000\" stroke-width=\"1.6\"/><text x=\"191.0\" y=\"45.0\" font-size=\"11\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-style=\"normal\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#000000\">\ud835\udd3d\u207f</text><line x1=\"86\" y1=\"42\" x2=\"154\" y2=\"42\" stroke=\"#000000\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" marker-end=\"url(#arr-20402)\"/><line x1=\"154\" y1=\"42\" x2=\"86\" y2=\"42\" stroke=\"#000000\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" marker-end=\"url(#arr-20402)\"/><text x=\"120\" y=\"34\" font-size=\"8.5\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-style=\"normal\" font-weight=\"normal\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#000000\">coordinates [\u00b7]_B</text><rect x=\"14\" y=\"84\" width=\"70\" height=\"34\" rx=\"0\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#000000\" stroke-width=\"1.6\"/><text x=\"49.0\" y=\"104.0\" font-size=\"9\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-style=\"normal\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#000000\">dim V = n</text><rect x=\"156\" y=\"84\" width=\"70\" height=\"34\" rx=\"0\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#000000\" stroke-width=\"1.6\"/><text x=\"191.0\" y=\"104.0\" font-size=\"9\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-style=\"normal\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#000000\">dim W = n</text><line x1=\"86\" y1=\"101\" x2=\"154\" y2=\"101\" stroke=\"#000000\" stroke-width=\"1.4\"/><text x=\"120\" y=\"96\" font-size=\"14\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-style=\"normal\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#000000\">\u2245</text><text x=\"108.30619999999999\" y=\"132\" font-size=\"8.5\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-style=\"normal\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#000000\">same dimension \u21d2 the spaces are structurally identical</text></svg>",
    "drawingCaption": "Any n-dimensional space over \ud835\udd3d is just a relabeled \ud835\udd3d\u207f",
    "coreTranslation": [
      "<strong>Isomorphism:</strong> an invertible linear map $V\\to W$. Isomorphic spaces behave identically as vector spaces.",
      "<strong>Theorem:</strong> finite-dimensional $V\\cong W\\iff\\dim V=\\dim W$. Choosing a basis gives the isomorphism $v\\mapsto[v]_B\\in\\mathbb{F}^n$.",
      "<strong>Payoff:</strong> every finite-dimensional question can be moved to $\\mathbb{F}^n$ and answered with matrices. Dimension is the <strong>only</strong> invariant of a vector space up to isomorphism."
    ],
    "math": "$$V\\cong W\\iff\\dim V=\\dim W,\\qquad V\\cong\\mathbb{F}^{n}\\ \\ (n=\\dim V)$$",
    "personalConnection": "Translating the same book into different languages: the plot (structure) is identical; only the words (basis choice) change.",
