    "drawingSvg": "<svg viewBox=\"0 0 240 145\" class=\"w-full h-full\"><defs><marker id=\"arr-21202\" viewBox=\"0 0 10 10\" refX=\"6\" refY=\"5\" markerWidth=\"5\" markerHeight=\"5\" orient=\"auto-start-reverse\"><path d=\"M 0 1.5 L 8 5 L 0 8.5 z\" fill=\"#000000\"/></marker></defs><rect x=\"14\" y=\"20\" width=\"90\" height=\"90\" rx=\"0\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#000000\" stroke-width=\"1.6\"/><rect x=\"14\" y=\"20\" width=\"90\" height=\"34\" rx=\"0\" fill=\"#d9dee7\" stroke=\"#000000\" stroke-width=\"1.4\" stroke-dasharray=\"4 3\"/><text x=\"59\" y=\"40\" font-size=\"9\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-style=\"normal\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#000000\">null T*</text><text x=\"59\" y=\"84\" font-size=\"9\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-style=\"normal\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#000000\">range T</text><text x=\"130\" y=\"64\" font-size=\"22\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-style=\"normal\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#000000\">\u22a5</text><rect x=\"150\" y=\"20\" width=\"76\" height=\"90\" rx=\"0\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#000000\" stroke-width=\"1.6\"/><rect x=\"150\" y=\"20\" width=\"76\" height=\"34\" rx=\"0\" fill=\"#e2e8f0\" stroke=\"#000000\" stroke-width=\"1.4\"/><text x=\"188\" y=\"40\" font-size=\"9\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-style=\"normal\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#000000\">range T</text><text x=\"120\" y=\"128\" font-size=\"9\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-style=\"normal\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#000000\">null T* = (range T)\u22a5,   range T* = (null T)\u22a5</text><text x=\"120\" y=\"142\" font-size=\"8.5\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-style=\"normal\" font-weight=\"normal\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#000000\">(and rank T = rank T*)</text></svg>",
    "drawingCaption": "What T* kills is exactly what is perpendicular to the range of T",
    "coreTranslation": [
      "<strong>Identities:</strong> $\\operatorname{null}T^*=(\\operatorname{range}T)^\\perp$ and $\\operatorname{range}T^*=(\\operatorname{null}T)^\\perp$.",
      "<strong>Matrix reading:</strong> the left null space of $A$ is orthogonal to the column space, and the row space is orthogonal to the null space.",
      "<strong>Dimension:</strong> $\\operatorname{rank}T^*=\\operatorname{rank}T$ (row rank = column rank). Also $V=\\operatorname{null}T\\oplus\\operatorname{range}T^*$ and $W=\\operatorname{range}T\\oplus\\operatorname{null}T^*$."
    ],
