      "<strong>Eigenvectors:</strong> $\\lambda=2$: $(1,-i)$; $\\lambda=0$: $(1,i)$. They are orthogonal: $\\langle(1,-i),(1,i)\\rangle=1\\cdot\\bar1+(-i)\\overline{i}=1+(-i)(-i)=1-1=0$ \u2713."
